---
config:
  layout: elk
---
flowchart TD
    A[Input Surface<br/>procedure / event / statement / records / facts] --> B[SignalPacket<br/>raw incoming signal]

    B --> C["extract-observations<br/>raw signal -> admitted fact"]
    C --> D[ObservationSet<br/>admitted facts / claims / inferred facts / missingness / contradictions / confidence]

    D --> E[E Layer<br/>experience / terrain capture]
    E --> F[r Layer<br/>reflection / primitive extraction / EP inference / drift check]

    F --> G[PrimitiveState<br/>∇P / μ / T / S / F / φ]
    F --> H[EPStateDelta<br/>clarity / pressure / safety / agency / reciprocity / integrity]

    D --> I["parse-procedure<br/>facts -> procedural spine"]
    I --> J[ProcedureMap<br/>R-steps / statuses / assumptions / unresolved rules]

    J --> K["infer-ep-state<br/>procedure + context -> EP deltas"]
    K --> H

    G --> L["compile-structure<br/>EP + primitives -> system geometry"]
    H --> L

    L --> M[StructureModel<br/>stocks / flows / constraints / thresholds / feedbacks / burdens / incentives / gates]

    M --> N["infer-product<br/>structure -> actual product by timescale"]
    N --> O[ProductProfile<br/>immediate / medium / long-horizon product]

    O --> P["compute-damages<br/>product + structure -> damage classes"]
    P --> Q[DamagesProfile<br/>classes / severity / affected parties]

    J --> R["causation-trace<br/>actual vs but-for path"]
    M --> R
    O --> R
    R --> S[CausationModel<br/>reverse trace / causal roles / alternative paths / but-for confidence]

    M --> T["challenge-model<br/>rival explanation / falsification"]
    O --> T
    S --> T
    T --> U[ChallengeReport<br/>rival models / discriminating evidence / prediction contest / ambiguity score]

    D --> V["ledger-entry<br/>audit-safe persistence"]
    J --> V
    H --> V
    M --> V
    O --> V
    Q --> V
    S --> V
    U --> V

    V --> W[R Layer<br/>move / hold / intervene / write / return]
    W --> X[Operator / External Action]
    X --> Y[Observed Return / New State]
    Y --> B

    classDef inputNode stroke:#818cf8,fill:#eef2ff
    classDef processorNode stroke:#a78bfa,fill:#f5f3ff
    classDef stateNode stroke:#2dd4bf,fill:#f0fdfa
    classDef outputNode stroke:#fb923c,fill:#fff7ed
    classDef layerNode stroke:#38bdf8,fill:#f0f9ff
    classDef feedbackNode stroke:#4ade80,fill:#f0fdf4

    class A inputNode
    class B,C,I,K,N,P,R,T,V processorNode
    class D,E,F,G,H,J,L,M,O,Q,S,U stateNode
    class W,X,Y layerNode
    class Y feedbackNode